input.prompt:
I'm planning a new feature for an Astro 6 + Tailwind v4 personal portfolio site. I need a detailed implementation plan (not code execution — just the plan) for adding an animated grid-line background to the "Approach" section of project case-study pages.

## Context already gathered

**Where "Approach" lives:**
- Content: MDX files like `/Users/trounceabout/Documents/Repos/Personal/internal-transit/src/content/projects/ping.mdx` wrap approach copy in `<section class="ping-section ping-section--approach">`
